00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:37.600
You are better off living alone. Nobody is better off when you're around.

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:45.060
1st Floor, Storeroom

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:49.200
People who only cause problems for others should stop being human.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:54.180
If not that, then they should spend the
rest of their lives in isolation. Get it?

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:57.020
Why do you say that?

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:59.040
That's what I did.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:03.300
But you live here, with other people...

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:05.780
We stopped being human.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:10.940
Akari was rude to you this morning. I apologize.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:13.180
Why would you apologize?

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:14.680
That was me.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:19.680
It wasn't me, but it was my body.

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:23.940
The three of us share three bodies.

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:29.180
All three of us have three personalities
and we share those personalities and memories.

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:34.600
So it was certainly Akari that berated you
this morning, but the body belonged to me.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:35.940
You're lying?

00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:36.740
I am.

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:41.700
Well. That's enough small talk.

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:43.840
To the point.

00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:48.120
I would not recommend discussing the police in front of Miss Ilia.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:50.700
Why is she so stubborn about it?

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:52.080
You want to know?

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:53.420
I would.

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:03.180
No criminal likes the police.

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:04.440
See?

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:13.100
You must have wondered why she lives on this island alone.

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:14.600
Why do you think?

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:16.980
Given her personality...

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:18.440
She failed.

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:21.860
Failed...how?

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:28.120
Kunagisa is unable to make dramatic vertical
movements alone. This is why you are with her.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:29.240
Right?

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:33.100
Right. What about it?

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:35.400
Miss Ilia is the opposite.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.260
So she's on this island all alone.

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:43.160
Have you ever seen her left arm?

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:48.260
If you saw the scars running across her wrist, you would understand.

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:52.920
Abusive Behavior Syndrome, it's called.

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:55.780
I imagine you've heard of it.

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:59.820
Abusive Behavior Syndrome...D.L.L.R. Syndrome?

00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:03.320
Teruko...that's...

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:08.340
Just as we are triplets, Miss Ilia is a twin.

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:11.540
Her sister, Miss Odette.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:16.460
Really? Where is this sister, and what is she diong?

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:17.420
She's dead.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:22.740
And it was Miss Ilia who killed Miss Odette.

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:24.340
Understand?

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:25.420
What that means.

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:26.860
Understand?

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:28.020
What my point is.

00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:33.600
You sat in there and ran your mouth off about Miss Ilia.

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:39.480
No matter what the reason there's
nothing worse...than what she is. You said.

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:43.140
You get why she won't call the police now?

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:45.780
If you do, go back to your room.

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:50.120
And don't make any more waves.

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:56.200
But...but Teruko...

00:10:57.020 --> 00:10:59.120
Don't make any waves?

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:00.120
That's...

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:02.680
That's my line.

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:04.600
Teruko.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:08.160
What?

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:10.260
Supposing...

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:18.340
Supposing there was a child raised for ten years without
any form of human interaction, not even with their parents...

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:23.920
Raised locked away in a basement...can you imagine
what kind of person they would become?

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:29.780
We are very different people.

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:32.640
Don't think for a second we're at all alike.

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:36.160
It's creepy, sickening, and very irritating.

00:11:36.780 --> 00:11:39.040
In that case, I'm sorry.

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:44.060
You may not know why Himena goes after you like that.

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:46.300
But the reason is obvious.

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:49.800
Himena can read your mind.

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:53.300
And everybody hates unclean things.

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:57.940
I said you are filth.

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:00.740
No need to repeat it.

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:02.920
I know what I am.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.940
I know my own mind.

00:12:04.940 --> 00:12:06.200
You do?

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:09.440
And yet you go on living?

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:11.340
You've got a lot of nerve.

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:13.240
I can almost respect that.

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:21.590
But do you imagine for a second that you could ever show
what lay inside you to anyone and have them actually like you?

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:27.100
Do you believe they would ever choose you?

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:32.360
That really is beyond the pale. The world will never forgive you for it.

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:36.360
You have no right. That is why...

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:39.100
You should try dying.

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:46.980
Jesus.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:50.760
The nonsense to end all nonsense.

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:57.300
That one definitely hurt.

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:04.380
Don't think about it. You've got other things to think about.

00:13:05.140 --> 00:13:09.260
What matters here is the information she gave you.

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:13.000
The wounds on her wrist. Ilia's background.

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:15.280
Abusive Behavior Syndrome.

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:20.260
Hand on...

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:27.360
Wait, wait, wait, wait...christ.

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:29.580
What was all of that?

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:34.000
Point is...Teruko is a huge liar.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.640
Just like I am.

